  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Food assistance and livelihoods support to vulnerable people in Amazonas, Apure and Sucre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide Food Security assistance to people affected by negative socioeconomic conditions and climate change in Amazoas, Apure and Sucre Regions. This WFP project provides food aid services to vulnerable people. The project provides humanitarian assistance to 10,000 people, including 1,740 women, 1,820 men, 6,440 children, and including 500 persons with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
